Update bundled Tesseract runtime sources from 5.5.2 to 5.5.4.

Modified by Mervin PDF on 2026-11-04.
Upstream release https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract/releases/tag/5.5.4
Upstream commit 7e548e6eff172f38f97664afe7f7ce40db36c8d6.
The bundled src/ and include/ match upstream 5.5.2. Preserve Artifex
source/fitz/tessocr.cpp, scripts/tesseract and platform build integration.
Includes the 5.5.3 and 5.5.4 model deserialization fixes.

